WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:05,630
Zhao Ya

2
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:06,970
can you walk faster

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,140
Like a turtle crawling

4
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,720
I just ate a piece of fruit today

5
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,550
I deserve this for being so hungry that I have no strength.

6
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:19,580
Who told you to go against Sister Weiwei?

7
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,380
Such a cunning person

8
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,700
What can you dig in one day?

9
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:32,370
Eat quickly and don't touch it

10
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:36,130
Keep your voice down

11
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:37,610
If you want to eat, eat quickly

12
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:39,370
We would all be unlucky if others saw us

13
00:00:39,690 --> 00:01:04,730
Sister Zhao Ya, you also eat. I’m full. I’m not hungry. You can eat by yourself, Sister Zhao Ya.

14
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:06,250
these things

15
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:08,370
You got it from Lin Feng, right?

16
00:01:08,810 --> 00:01:09,810
last night i woke up

17
00:01:09,810 --> 00:01:10,930
I haven't seen you yet

18
00:01:10,930 --> 00:01:13,130
You must have stolen the cat and ran out to find Lin Feng, right?

19
00:01:14,540 --> 00:01:15,780
I will keep it a secret for you

20
00:01:16,370 --> 00:01:17,330
even death

21
00:01:17,860 --> 00:01:21,990
I will never betray you, silly girl

22
00:01:22,470 --> 00:01:24,390
We are all on the same rope now, scolding each other.

23
00:01:24,670 --> 00:01:26,550
Finding a way to survive is better than anything else
